    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41168" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισύ-στᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gathering, riotous meeting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῡ ὄχλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					24.12
				</span></i>
			 (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίστασις</span>) ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ τῶν κρατούντων τῆς χώρας βαρβάρων
					ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					708.27
				</span></i>
			 (Istropolis, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>) ; <i>insurrection,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Beros.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				16.40
			</span></i>(<i><span class="en">
				17.5
			</span></i>): c. gen., <i>rising against,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Κυρίου</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				26.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>collection,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					11.127
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδατίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίστασις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Cor.</u>
				11.28
			</span></i>.</div>
